    "agent_final_response": "\n\nPerfect! I've successfully completed all four tasks for the MegaCorp deal:\n\n## ✅ Summary of Actions Completed:\n\n### 1. Found the Opportunity \"MegaCorp - Enterprise License\"\n- **Opportunity ID:** d79596c3-c7b8-11f1-b74e-ee18f99d1ded\n- **Amount:** $350,000\n- **Sales Stage:** Negotiation\n- **Probability:** 75%\n- **Date Closed:** 2026-11-04\n- **Account:** MegaCorp\n- **Lead Source:** Trade Show\n\n### 2. Created Zoom Meeting\n- **Meeting ID:** M93d2559eb720\n- **Topic:** MegaCorp\n- **Start Time:** October 15, 2026 at 2:00 PM UTC\n- **Duration:** 60 minutes\n- **Status:** Scheduled\n- **Description:** Internal deal review meeting for MegaCorp Enterprise License opportunity\n\n### 3. Added Calendar Event\n- **Event ID:** 81dd75a3-87bb-4539-99ed-f9273b74567e\n- **Summary:** MegaCorp\n- **Time:** October 15, 2026, 2:00 PM - 3:00 PM UTC\n- **Status:** Confirmed\n- **Description:** Internal deal review meeting for MegaCorp Enterprise License opportunity\n\n### 4. Updated Opportunity Description\n- **Previous:** \"Enterprise license deal for manufacturing operations platform\"\n- **Updated:** \"Enterprise license deal for manufacturing operations platform - deal review scheduled\"\n\nThe internal deal review meeting is now scheduled in both Zoom and your calendar, and the CRM opportunity has been updated to reflect that the deal review has been scheduled. The MegaCorp deal ($350K) is in the final negotiation stage with 75% probability, so this review meeting will be crucial for closing the deal before the November 4th close date.",
